From ee6405bc489f952dcde4ce77558d3d7b3fc43b42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AOSP RK3576 Baseline <uhf-platform@localbuild>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:31:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/17] uhf: bless the UHF-SRS-001 API surface (make
 update-api)

Runs `make update-api` now that the API Lint violations from the
previous commit are fixed. Adds:

- core/api/current.txt: the public-API pieces every app can see even
  without UHF_CONFIGURE - Manifest.permission.UHF_READ/UHF_WRITE, the
  UHF permission-group, and PackageManager.FEATURE_UHF_READER.
- core/api/system-current.txt: the full @SystemApi surface added across
  this patch series - UhfManager, UhfSession, TagCallback,
  InventoryParams/StreamParams/StreamStats (with the Millis-renamed
  getters/setters), TagFilter, UhfDeviceInfo, UhfReaderInfo, UhfTag,
  UhfException.

No hand-editing: both files are metalava's own generated diff, reviewed
before committing to confirm nothing beyond the expected UHF additions
came through and that the MissingGetterMatchingBuilder-suppressed
setAntennaTargetScanTime() didn't spuriously demand a matching getter in
the signature file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
